<SCENARIO VER="105">
<BR>
<TXSPN>Well, Eiichiro, shall we go? No need to worry anymore.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "1000"}
<EVENT VALUE="TEXTCLEAR">
<PG>
{WAIT "1000" "NORMAL" "SKIP"}
<BR>
<BR>
Right, Mother. Let's leave the rest to them.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
There's no need for us to butt in anymore.
{WAIT "100" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{DELETECG "文字カウント画像" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{PAUSE ""}
{MESOFF "1000"}
<EVENT VALUE="TEXTCLEAR">
<PG>
{}
<EVENT VALUE="MESEND">
